      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Acme.Lib.Text.Formatter Navigable aliased Private
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Acme.Lib.Customer.Address Navigable address Private
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Acme.Lib.Text.Formatter Navigable second Private
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Acme.Lib.Money Navigable third Private
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Acme.Lib.Money Navigable prices Private [*] {ordered}
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Missing Navigable missing Private
      association Acme.App.Shop NonNavigable -- Other.Things.Widget Navigable widget Private
